1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
(English Subtitle) Growing.Pains.S01E12 -= A.Christmas.Story =- Subripped by zerox

2
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,900
我的圣人呢？
Where are my wise men?

3
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,760
坐火车去了
Taking the A train.

4
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:17,820
迈克，他怎么坐到车轨上了？
Mike, what are the wise men doing on the train track?

5
00:01:18,745 --> 00:01:21,110
他们是圣人，自有圣人之道
Hey, they're wise men. They must know what they're doing.

6
00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:23,120
导演：约翰.特莱西
麦克，够了
Mike, come on.

7
00:01:27,954 --> 00:01:29,612
奇迹啊
It's a miracle.

8
00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:32,000
麦克
Mike.

9
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,700
★我们三个国王都喜欢.
We three kings We know what we like

10
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:40,200
★兴麦克一起过圣诞
Spending Christmas With our friend Mike

11
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,360
本，够了!
Ben, stop that.

12
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:44,980
饭后再拆礼物
You'll get to open one present after dinner.

13
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:48,980
你说过每个人都会有一份.
But I thought you said everyone's Christmas-Eve present...

14
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:51,160
绑着红色大蝴蝶结的礼物的
would have a big, red bow on it.

15
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,100
会有的
It will.

16
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:58,500
就我没有
Well, everyone has one with a big, red bow on it except me.

17
00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:01,720
也许我们应该说出真相
Well, maybe we should tell him the truth, guys.

18
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,020
真相？
What truth?

19
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:06,360
本，你是领养来的
Well, Ben, you're adopted...

20
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,760
圣诞老人不知道你的新地址
and Santa doesn't know your new address.

21
00:02:08,962 --> 00:02:11,495
-妈妈! -麦克
- Mom! - Mike.

22
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:14,340
只有麦克才是领养的
The only one of us kids who's adopted is Mike.

23
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,220
我不是领养的
I'm not adopted.

24
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,680
快了
Not yet.

25
00:02:18,538 --> 00:02:21,504
我的礼物确实不在那里
My present's definitely not here.

26
00:02:21,900 --> 00:02:24,080
也许圣诞老人还没有买你的礼物
Well, Ben, maybe Santa just hasn't brought it yet.

27
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:27,060
拜托，世上哪有圣诞老人
Come on. There's no such thing as Santa.

28
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:30,800
本，你怎么知道没有呢？
Hey, Ben, you know that for a fact?

29
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:34,480
好吧，好吧，听我说.
Okay. Okay, I tell you what.

30
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:37,800
我现在就去吃饼干
I'll go get myself some Christmas cookies, and who knows?

31
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:41,940
或许圣诞老人会认为 这是送我礼物的最佳时机
Maybe Santa will decide this is the perfect opportunity to bring my present.

32
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:43,680
懂我意思吗？
Know what I mean?

33
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,700
你们要几点去拿礼物？
So, when are you guys gonna pick it up?

34
00:02:50,770 --> 00:02:52,140
四点钟左右
Around 4:00.

35
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:53,580
他到时一定会很开心
He's gonna be so excited.

36
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:58,000
杰森，我的礼物会让我开心吗？
So, Jason, how excited am I gonna be about my present?

37
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:02,240
那就要看你乖不乖，顽不顽皮
Well, that depends. Have you been naughty, or have you been nice?

38
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:04,540
我又顽皮又乖
I've been nice and naughty.

39
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:08,060
圣诞老人就喜欢你这样
Santa likes it when you talk like that.

40
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:13,626
-大家快来!下雪了 -好啊!
- Hey, everybody! It's snowing. - Oh, all right!

41
00:03:13,626 --> 00:03:16,260
-白色的圣诞节! -瞧瞧!
- All right, on Christmas! - Oh, yeah! Look at that.

42
00:03:16,380 --> 00:03:17,960
真漂亮
Oh, it's beautiful.

43
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:21,840
圣诞节真温馨.
You know, Christmas is sort of neat...

44
00:03:21,935 --> 00:03:23,920
一家五口，济济一堂
I mean, just the five of us hanging out...

45
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:28,020
漂亮，温暖的家，真有气氛
in a nice, warm house, kind of getting into the spirit.

46
00:03:28,708 --> 00:03:30,136
-麦克？ -麦克？
- Mike? - Mike?

47
00:03:31,678 --> 00:03:35,143
你们以为我只会招人讨厌吗？
Hey, you think I like being obnoxious all the time?

48
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:38,580
对，我确实如此
Yeah, I guess I do.

49
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:41,020
我去开门
I'll get it.

50
00:03:42,220 --> 00:03:44,760
有这么一个孩子真是三生有幸
What did we do to be blessed with such a child?

51
00:03:49,900 --> 00:03:51,440
爸，有病人来了
Dad, it's one of your patients.

52
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:55,760
波德维尔先生!这装扮不错
Mr. Bodewell! I think the suit looks great.

53
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,280
医生，我们得聊聊
I gotta talk to you, Doc.

54
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,380
你不是要去孤儿院做圣诞老人吗？
Aren't you supposed to be playing Santa down at the orphanage?

55
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:03,680
-我演不下去了 -为什么？
- I can't go through with that. - Why not?

56
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:05,680
瞧我的
Watch this.

57
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,000
呵呵
Ho, ho.

58
00:04:10,660 --> 00:04:11,580
咱来聊聊
Let's talk.

59
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:16,220
波德维尔，上周的你为了.
Walter, when I saw you last week...

60
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:19,560
能在孤儿院做圣诞老人 而感到兴高采烈
you were so excited about playing Santa for those kids at the orphanage.

61
00:04:19,580 --> 00:04:20,340
后来怎么了？
What happened?

62
00:04:21,180 --> 00:04:23,220
医生，孩子们一定会讨厌我
Doc, the kids are gonna hate me.

63
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,740
为什么会讨厌你？
Now, why should they hate you?

64
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,040
就像大家讨厌我一样
Same reason everybody hates me.

65
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,560
我让大家都不愉快
I make people uncomfortable.

66
00:04:29,180 --> 00:04:30,380
瞧，你开始坐立不安了
Look at you. You're fidgeting.

67
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,520
我没有坐立不安
I'm not fidgeting.

68
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:38,420
好了，你一辈子最害怕的是什么？
Okay, now, Walter, what's the one thing in your life that bothers you the most?

69
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:42,960
杂志上掉下来的订阅卡
Those little subscription cards that fall out of magazines.

70
00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:44,540
波德维尔.
Walter.

71
00:04:47,740 --> 00:04:49,560
-最害怕寂寞 -是的
- Being alone. - Yes.

72
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:52,580
你不觉得孤儿院的孩子们很寂寞吗？
And don't you think those kids at the orphanage are lonely, too?

73
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:57,980
是的，但是我不知道怎么跟孩子们说话
Yeah, but I don't know how to talk to kids, Doc.

74
00:04:58,160 --> 00:05:01,040
放松吧，你会知道该说什么
Well, relax. Just be yourself. You'll know what to say.

75
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,620
我确实有些话要说
Well, I've been kicking around a few things.

76
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:06,820
很好，假设你走进孤儿院
Good. Imagine you've just come into the orphanage...

77
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:09,020
身边都是快活的小脸蛋
and you're surrounded by all those happy little faces...

78
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:10,180
你会说些什么？
and what do you say?

79
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:15,520
“敬启者..”
"To whom it may concern...

80
00:05:16,820 --> 00:05:19,380
“适才忽觉明日乃圣诞良辰”
"it has come to my attention that tomorrow is Christmas.

81
00:05:20,340 --> 00:05:23,820
“故略备薄礼，聊表祝贺..”
"Consequently, I bring items in conjunction with..."

82
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:27,240
作为一名会计 你有时候未免倾向于.
Walter, I wonder if, as an accountant, you might have a tendency to be...

83
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:29,720
我知道，太正式了
I know, I know. Too formal.

84
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:34,700
波德维尔 圣诞老人很少说这样的话
Walter, I don't know that that much talk is expected of Santa.

85
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:37,080
也许该传统一点
I might just go with something more traditional.

86
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:41,900
例如：“呵呵呵!孩子们，礼物来了!”
You know, like, "Ho! Ho! Ho! Boy, do I have gifts for you!"

87
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:45,780
显然你做过儿童工作
You have obviously worked with children.

88
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:49,640
你也会很好的
Come on, Walter. You'll be fine.

89
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:52,200
我还不知道礼物对不对呢
Oh, Doc, I don't even know if I brought the right gifts.

90
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:54,500
孩子们什么礼物都喜欢
You can't go wrong with kids. They love gifts.

91
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:56,240
这是什么？
See what you got here.

92
00:05:58,260 --> 00:05:59,220
碎牛肉？
Ground beef?

93
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:02,720
有话就说吧
Go ahead. Say it.

94
00:06:03,062 --> 00:06:05,021
早知道就买猪肉
I should've bought pork.

95
00:06:05,860 --> 00:06:07,540
就差这么一点
Well, that's a close call, Walter.

96
00:06:08,180 --> 00:06:09,740
好，还有些什么
Come on. What else have you got?

97
00:06:11,820 --> 00:06:12,300
厨房用品
Tupperware.

98
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:15,660
这是兴牛肉配套的
Sure, I thought it goes with the beef.

99
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:21,600
用来放牛肉丸
You know, they'll use it to mix up some Swedish meatballs or...

100
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,560
买错礼物了
The gifts are wrong.

101
00:06:26,386 --> 00:06:30,187
医生，我想要让孩子们开心的礼物
Doc, I wanna give these kids something that's gonna make them happy...

102
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:32,380
不知道送什么好
but I don't know what to bring.

103
00:06:34,093 --> 00:06:37,895
我说送些没用的东西吧
Walter, I'm gonna throw out something kind of crazy now.

104
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:40,240
玩具
Toys.

105
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:42,520
玩具？
Toys?

106
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,160
玩具
Toys.

107
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:52,060
玩具确实没用，但也许合适
Doc, that is so crazy, that just might work.

108
00:06:54,447 --> 00:06:55,836
戴上吧
Here.

109
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:03,322
不用骗我了，你们去拿礼物吧？
You guys can't fool me. You're going to get my present.

110
00:07:03,322 --> 00:07:08,659
-哪里？我们是去… -找铁匠，凯罗要换双鞋子
- Nonsense, Ben, we're going to the... - Blacksmith. Carol needs new shoes.

111
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:12,660
我们要去退掉麦克的礼物
Actually, we're going to return all of Mike's gifts.

112
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:17,000
-他的车匙给你了 -好啊你们
- You take his Porsche. - What? Oh, you guys.

113
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,820
算了，告诉我是什么礼物吧
Come on. Just tell me what my present is.

114
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:24,800
这是你和圣诞老人的事情
That's between you and Santa.

115
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:28,640
我现在越来越讨厌 这个传说中的人物了
I'm getting pretty sick of this particular folk hero.

116
00:07:30,210 --> 00:07:33,580
-别那么大声 -再见
- I wouldn't say that too loudly. - Bye, guys.

117
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:34,460
-再见 -再见
- All right, bye-bye. - Bye.

118
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,080
-祝你愉快 -再见
- Have fun. - See you later.

119
00:07:37,457 --> 00:07:39,892
麦克，凯罗
Mike, Carol.

120
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:44,840
凯罗，麦克.. 知道圣诞节要怎样吗？
Carol, Mike. Do you know what Christmas means to me?

121
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:47,000
要互助互爱，坦诚相见
It means caring, sharing.

122
00:07:48,180 --> 00:07:49,769
-本，我们不会告诉你的 -本，我们不会告诉你的
- We're not telling you, Ben. - We're not telling you, Ben.

123
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:51,320
我喜欢你的架势
But I like your style.

124
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:55,460
这种要问谁才能知道呢？
Who do you have to talk to to get some hard facts around here?

125
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:58,800
你该找一个穿红衣服的胖子
Well, I'd look for a fat man in a red suit.

126
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:04,480
-波德维尔先生 -你父亲在否？
- Mr. Bodewell. - Is your father here?

127
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:08,900
-不在，刚出去了 -进来等吧
- No, he stepped out for a minute. - Would you like to come in and wait?

128
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:11,020
不，等不了啦
No, I can't wait.

129
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,980
那我告诉他，你曾来过 圣诞快乐!
Okay, I'll tell him you were here. Merry Christmas!

130
00:08:18,660 --> 00:08:20,320
他一点都不快乐
He sure looked unhappy.

131
00:08:20,967 --> 00:08:25,198
麦克，凯罗 凯罗，麦克
Mike, Carol. Carol, Mike.

132
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,000
谁告诉我给他1块钱
$1 for the hiding place.

133
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:30,060
本，这有违圣诞精神
Ben, that's hardly the Christmas spirit.

134
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,900
10块钱呢？
$10?
★叮叮当，叮叮当.
Jingle bells, jingle bells

135
00:08:34,547 --> 00:08:38,244
我不会说的，起码要20块嘛
I wasn't going to tell him, not for less than $20.

136
00:08:47,393 --> 00:08:49,451
谁在上面？
Who is up there?

137
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:51,440
你说呢？
Who do you think?

138
00:08:56,140 --> 00:08:57,000
哇!
Whoa!

139
00:08:59,160 --> 00:08:59,820
圣诞老人？
Santa?

140
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:11,040
圣诞老人!难以置信!
Santa Claus! Wow, this is unbelievable!

141
00:09:12,340 --> 00:09:16,460
小子走开，我要跳下来 不想让你看见
Get out of there, kid. Look, I'm coming down. I don't want you to see this.

142
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:21,720
方便的话，把礼物扔下来吧
Well, if it's any easier for you, you can throw my present down.

143
00:09:23,260 --> 00:09:27,080
礼物？好的，送你一份
Present? Oh, okay, I'll give you a present.

144
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,200
生牛肉？
Raw meat?

145
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,740
不好吗？
You got a problem with that?

146
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,380
我想要的不是这个
Well, it wasn't my first choice.

147
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:44,340
圣诞节前夜，好吃的东西真多
Christmas Eve, a real "stuff your face" kind of holiday.

148
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,340
本，过来吃鸡蛋卷
Come on, Ben. Let's have some eggnog.

149
00:09:47,340 --> 00:09:51,220
麦克!凯罗，圣诞老人在屋顶上 瞧他送我的礼物
Mike! Carol! Santa's on the roof, and look what he gave me.

150
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:55,358
生牛肉？什么天方夜谭？
Raw meat? Ben, what are you talking about?

151
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,380
快来
Come on.

152
00:09:57,597 --> 00:10:02,258
圣诞老人，我哥哥姐姐来了 有礼物吗？
Santa, my brother and sister are here. You got anything for them?

153
00:10:04,940 --> 00:10:05,540
厨房用品？
Tupperware?

154
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:07,700
这是送给那位小姐的
Oh, it's for the young lady.

155
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:10,260
请让开
Would you please get out of there?

156
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:12,920
波德维尔先生？
Mr. Bodewell?

157
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,320
是的
You got it.

158
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:16,640
你在上面干什么？
Mr. Bodewell, what are you doing up there?

159
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:19,780
我要从你们家烟囱跳下来，插水式
I'm gonna dive down your chimney, head first.

160
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:23,100
天哪，他要自杀
Oh, my God. He's going to commit suicide in our fireplace.

161
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:25,660
好吧，我去叫警察
Okay, I'm gonna call the cops.

162
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,680
不，别叫警察
No, no cops.

163
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:31,240
我没说叫“警察”
Okay, I didn't say "cops."

164
00:10:31,263 --> 00:10:33,833
我是说“请喝茶”
I said "mops."

165
00:10:33,833 --> 00:10:37,459
不用喝茶了
Yeah, well, no mops, either.

166
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,860
好的，免茶水
Right, no mops.

167
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:42,180
什么都不喝
Right, or cleaning supplies of any kind.

168
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:47,140
波德维尔先生，先别动
Mr. Bodewell, just stay where you are.

169
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:50,560
我马上回来，你们要一直跟他谈话
I'll be right back. I think you're supposed to keep him talking.

170
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,300
跳下来以后继续谈？
Even after he jumps?

171
00:10:54,380 --> 00:10:58,040
下来吃点鸡蛋卷吗？
Mr. Bodewell, why don't you come down and have some eggnog?

172
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,680
我都要死了，还吃什么鸡蛋卷？
I'm about to kill myself, you offer me eggnog?

173
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:06,240
上面写着“适合任何场合食用”
Well, it says here, "Festive for all occasions."

174
00:11:06,265 --> 00:11:09,400
你真行
Oh, Mike.

175
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:11,760
本，到你了
Okay. Ben, your turn.

176
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:17,420
波德维尔先生 谢谢你送我的生牛肉
Mr. Bodewell, even though you're not Santa, thank you for the meat.

177
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,578
明年肯定用得着
I know I'll use it for years to come.

178
00:11:19,578 --> 00:11:24,205
你还是坦白说出来吧 你不喜欢这块肉
Come on, kid. Admit it. You hate the meat.

179
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:27,300
不，你让我美梦成真了
No, really, it's a child's dream come true.

180
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:32,820
嘴巴真甜，可是瞒不过我
Nice try, kid, but I know the truth.

181
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,000
你其实讨厌我
You hate me.

182
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:37,940
大家都讨厌我!
Everybody! Everybody hates me!

183
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:40,940
所以我活不下去了
That's why I can't go on living.

184
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:43,340
人总得活下去
But you have to go on living.

185
00:11:43,540 --> 00:11:46,180
-为什么？ -等等，我来告诉你
- Why? - Wait a second. I'll tell you.

186
00:11:46,238 --> 00:11:49,430
-什么东西？ -爸爸的教科书
- Hey, what's that? - One of Dad's textbooks.

187
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:54,420
波德维尔先生，“一个想自杀的人..”
Mr. Bodewell, I know that "a suicidal person"...

188
00:11:54,860 --> 00:11:56,380
“例如阁下..”
such as yourself...

189
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,600
“他们只会通过黑暗的管道来看世界”
"can only see things through a dark tunnel...

190
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:02,920
“但通过交谈和长期资料后..”
"but with proper counseling and long-term therapy...

191
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:07,240
“病人会建立内在的自信 详看费博的名著..”
"the patient can build his inner confidence, as outlined in Ferber's landmark study...

192
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,460
“<绝望人生>”
"Life Without Hope."

193
00:12:10,980 --> 00:12:12,080
波德维尔先生？
Mr. Bodewell?

194
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,660
还在吗？
Mr. Bodewell, are you there?

195
00:12:16,460 --> 00:12:19,400
我在，你还没念完吧？
Yeah, sure. I didn't think you were finished reading.

196
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:24,440
千万别跳下来
Mr. Bodewell, please don't jump.

197
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,780
★圣诞老人来了.
Here comes Santa Claus

198
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:31,717
★圣诞老人来了.
Here comes Santa Claus Right down

199
00:12:31,717 --> 00:12:33,152
从屋顶上来!
Right down our chimney!

200
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,220
什么？
What?

201
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,760
波德维尔先生在屋顶，他要跳下来!
Mr. Bodewell's on the roof, and he's about to jump down the chimney!

202
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:39,860
天哪!
Oh, my God!

203
00:12:45,331 --> 00:12:47,588
波德维尔先生？
Mr. Bodewell?

204
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:55,440
-波德维尔 -医生，别过来
- Walter. - Don't come near me, Doc.

205
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,980
我发誓我要跳了
I swear I'll dive.

206
00:12:57,780 --> 00:13:00,946
别着急，我不过来 只是想聊聊
Okay, don't worry. I'll stay right here. I just wanna talk to you.

207
00:13:00,946 --> 00:13:04,239
我不要谈，我要死
Well, I don't wanna talk. I wanna die.

208
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,300
你的问题是暂时性的
Walter, your problems are temporary.

209
00:13:10,500 --> 00:13:11,660
而死是永恒的
Death is permanent.

210
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:16,420
跳下去就没第二次了.. 你在干什么？
You jump, and there's no second... Walter, what are you doing?

211
00:13:17,220 --> 00:13:18,860
量一下尺寸够不够
I want to make sure I'm gonna fit.

212
00:13:19,220 --> 00:13:21,440
卡在中间那才叫惨哪
I'll be damned if I'm gonna get stuck in there.

213
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:24,480
今天下午是怎么了？
What happened this afternoon?

214
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:29,300
孤儿院的孩子们都讨厌我
The kids at the orphanage hated me.

215
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:32,840
竟然有这种事情？
Well, I find that hard to believe, Walter.

216
00:13:35,381 --> 00:13:39,583
给8，9岁的孩子办圣诞老人？
I mean, you played Santa to a bunch of 8-year-olds.

217
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:42,460
是不是你误解了？
Could it be that you misinterpreted their response?

218
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,320
你自己看吧
You tell me.

219
00:13:46,540 --> 00:13:48,720
“这个圣诞老人是疯子”
"This Santa eats fruitcake."

220
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:53,220
对，屋顶上有个人要跳下来
That's right. A man on the roof, threatening to jump down the chimney.

221
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:57,880
是的，很胖，花白胡子，一身红衣服
Well, he's a rather large man in a red suit, with a white beard.

222
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,180
不，他没有驯鹿和拉车
No, he doesn't have any reindeer.

223
00:14:02,608 --> 00:14:05,205
我了解你心中郁闷.
Walter, I understand what you're going through.

224
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:08,400
此刻心灰意冷，可是也不能这样
Things look bleak for you right now, but you can't do this.

225
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:09,660
你说得对
You're right.

226
00:14:09,815 --> 00:14:13,800
穿这件衣服是跳不下去的
Not with this jacket on. I'm never gonna fit.

227
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:17,080
-生命诚可贵 -别过来
- Walter, your life is too valuable. - Don't come near me.

228
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:21,440
面对现实吧，我这辈子是白过了
Let's face it, Doc. My life is a big zero.

229
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:25,260
一天天这样过又何苦呢？
I wake up every day, and I'm wondering why.

230
00:14:26,300 --> 00:14:28,540
把腰围除以3.14.
Divide the circumference by pi...

231
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,940
为什么？偏偏是我？
Why? Why me?

232
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:37,700
为什么我是波德维尔？ 既然命该如此
Why was I chosen to be Walter Bodewell, the man whose destiny was to...

233
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:41,900
该死，电池没电了
Damn, my batteries are dead.

234
00:14:43,280 --> 00:14:45,380
医生，可以问你一个问题吗？
Doc, would you please tell me one thing?

235
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:49,440
-问吧？ -39除以3.14159是多少？
- What, Walter? - What's 39 divided by 3.1416?

236
00:14:50,900 --> 00:14:53,280
我不会帮你算这个的
Walter, I'm not gonna help you with this.

237
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,420
那好，随你
Oh, well, fine. Have it your way.

238
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:56,740
波德维尔
Walter.

239
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:00,300
波德维尔!
Walter!

240
00:15:02,835 --> 00:15:05,636
这样一了百了.
Walter, you wanna be happy.

241
00:15:05,671 --> 00:15:08,301
不能解决问题
You don't wanna give up like this.

242
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:09,680
为什么不能？
Why shouldn't I? Huh, Doc?

243
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,800
你说，为什么不能？
You tell me. Why shouldn't I give up?

244
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:16,180
既然在8，9岁的孩子们前面 都当不好圣诞老人
I mean, if I can't make it as Santa Claus with a bunch of 8-year-old orphans...

245
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:19,040
我又怎么能当好波德维尔？
how am I supposed to make it as Walter Bodewell?

246
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:20,960
你试试看.
Well, you work at it, Walter.

247
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,920
一个个问题地解决
You chip away at each problem.

248
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:25,860
扪心自问.
You speak from the heart...

249
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,940
偶尔不用写发言稿
occasionally without a prepared statement.

250
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:30,100
慢慢的.
And then, when you listen back...

251
00:15:30,140 --> 00:15:33,240
你就会像大家一样
you know, you start to sound just like everybody else.

252
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:34,480
一切很正常
You're human, Walter.

253
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:37,240
每一个人也会偶尔神伤.
That means occasionally you're gonna have some pain...

254
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,860
偶尔寂寞
and sometimes you're gonna feel lonely...

255
00:15:39,420 --> 00:15:41,360
可是若能伸出手来.
but if you just keep reaching out...

256
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:44,180
总会有人愿、意拉你一把
there's gonna be somebody there to lend you a hand.

257
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:51,980
谢谢你，医生，永别了
Thanks, Doc. Goodbye.

258
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:53,440
波德维尔!
Walter!

259
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:57,540
-什么？ -我想通了
对了!
Oh, that's it. That's it!

260
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:58,660
你说得对!
- What's it? - I see it now.

261
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:00,320
我也要自杀，碰到问题.
Yeah, this is a good idea, Walter.

262
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:04,580
I'm gonna kill myself, too. That's it. You just have a problem...

263
00:16:04,580 --> 00:16:06,740
跳烟囱就得了
and you jump down the chimney, Walter.

264
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:09,460
-你不能 -为什么不能？这是我家的烟囱
- No, you can't do that. - Why not, Walter? It's my chimney.

265
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:11,480
你胡说什么了？
What are you talking about?

266
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:15,260
你以为只有你有问题吗？
Walter, you think you're the only one with problems?

267
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,442
我也有.
Well, I got a problem, too, Walter...

268
00:16:16,442 --> 00:16:20,740
因为我有个病人在屋顶上扬言要自杀
'cause I got a big guy on my roof I've been counseling for four years...

269
00:16:20,740 --> 00:16:23,482
这个病人我已经治疗4年了 徒劳无功
and he's threatening to kill himself because I can't talk him out of it.

270
00:16:23,482 --> 00:16:26,247
我受到自己的良心责备啊!
I can't live with that on my conscience, Walter.

271
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:30,000
-不，不! -不好意思，我先
- No. No! - Excuse me. You mind if I go first?

272
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,360
医生，你不能这样
Doc, I'm not gonna let you do this.

273
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:33,340
你还有老婆孩子
You have a wife. You have children.

274
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:36,000
没有我，他们的圣诞节还是好好的
Their Christmas is pretty much shot as it is.

275
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:38,080
别拦着我
你疯了？
You are crazy!

276
00:16:38,140 --> 00:16:39,200
医生，我不能让你去死
Don't try to stop me, Walter.

277
00:16:39,498 --> 00:16:41,932
No, Doc, I can't let you do this!

278
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:47,340
医生，别哭了，可怜兮兮的
Doc, quit whining. It's really pathetic.

279
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:51,180
-我可没哭 -那是谁？
- It's not me. - Well, what is it?

280
00:17:06,980 --> 00:17:09,760
你给儿子送了条小狗？
So you bought a puppy for your kid for Christmas?

281
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:14,080
他一直渴望有一条小狗
He's been asking for one for years, so...

282
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:17,760
-被他提前发现了 -是啊
- I guess he found it a little early. - Yeah.

283
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,600
棕色的
这狗是什么样子的？
What kind of puppy is it?

284
00:17:23,060 --> 00:17:23,640
Brown.

285
00:17:25,740 --> 00:17:25,911
它在干什么？
What is he doing?

286
00:17:25,911 --> 00:17:28,503
在舔我的脸
Licking my face.

287
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:33,320
-本，你在干嘛.. -我以前养过小狗
- Ben, what are you... - I used to have a dog.

288
00:17:34,060 --> 00:17:35,460
德国牧羊犬
I had a German Shepherd.

289
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:39,460
听话
那条狗听话吗？
Was he a nice dog?

290
00:17:40,940 --> 00:17:41,180
Yeah.

291
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:44,040
它是唯一.
He was the only guy...

292
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:46,060
看见我不会不舒服的生物
who didn't get uncomfortable when he was around me.

293
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:49,101
记得我们常常玩得好开心
I remember we used to have this great game we played together.

294
00:17:49,101 --> 00:17:52,967
我们玩的是“球”
It was called "ball."

295
00:17:54,820 --> 00:17:57,760
把球扔出去，它捡回来？
You mean, you'd throw the ball, and he'd go fetch it?

296
00:17:58,100 --> 00:17:59,580
这样也好玩
That would've worked, too.

297
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:03,100
它后来怎样了？
What happened to him?

298
00:18:08,020 --> 00:18:08,153
死了
He died.

299
00:18:08,153 --> 00:18:10,687
17年了
Seventeen years ago.

300
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:13,000
以后再也没有谁跟我一起住了
He was the last person I ever lived with.

301
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:16,020
你伤心了？
Were you sad?

302
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,040
是的
Yeah.

303
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:20,960
你哭了吗？
Did you cry?

304
00:18:24,420 --> 00:18:24,780
哭了
Yes.

305
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,780
你还要自杀吗？
Are you still gonna kill yourself?

306
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:30,400
不知道
本.
Ben.

307
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:32,640
I don't know.

308
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:39,000
不自杀的话，我这狗可以送你
Well, if you don't kill yourself, you can have my puppy.

309
00:18:39,918 --> 00:18:44,022
波德维尔先生？
Hello? Mr. Bodewell?

310
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:49,080
-妈妈，他怎么了？ -我也不知道
- Mom, what happened to him? - I don't know, honey.

311
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:53,260
波德维尔先生？爸爸？
Mr. Bodewell? Dad?

312
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:56,880
杰森？
Jason? Jason?

313
00:18:58,700 --> 00:18:59,560
来了
Yes?

314
00:19:00,372 --> 00:19:02,940
-爸爸! -爸爸!
- Dad! - Dad!

315
00:19:03,980 --> 00:19:05,500
波德维尔先生!
Mr. Bodewell!

316
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:08,760
-杰森，没事吧？ -我们都没事
- Jason, are you okay? - Yeah, I think we're okay.

317
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:12,820
-这是我的小狗 -真可爱
- This is my puppy. - He's a nice one.

318
00:19:17,900 --> 00:19:19,100
圣诞快乐!
Merry Christmas.

319
00:19:32,820 --> 00:19:36,560
我宣布，西弗一家可以打开礼物了
And now it's time for the opening of the Seaver family Christmas-Eve presents.

320
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:40,960
记住，这些礼物不是我买的
Oh, now, remember, I didn't buy any of these presents...

321
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:43,020
不喜欢可不能怪我
so if you don't like your present, it's not my fault.

322
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:46,185
-波德维尔 -对不起，这样吧
- Walter. - Oh, I'm sorry. Oh, here.

323
00:19:46,185 --> 00:19:48,910
-嗯 -好多了
- Yeah. - Better. Better.

324
00:19:49,020 --> 00:19:52,600
这是凯罗的，这是麦克的
Okay, this one's for Carol. This one's for Mike.

325
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:59,280
“亲爱的麦克，这是我家3代的传统”
"Dear Mike, this has been handed down in our family...

326
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:02,800
“送给每个到达成年的男子”
"for three generations to each man as he comes of age."

327
00:20:06,471 --> 00:20:12,167
刮胡刀？咱俩换吧
A razor. I think we better switch.

328
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:13,820
什么？要破坏传统？
What, and break family tradition?

329
00:20:14,947 --> 00:20:17,749
这是妈妈的礼物.
Now one for Mom...

330
00:20:17,749 --> 00:20:20,285
-还有.. -谢谢
- and... - Oh, thank you.

331
00:20:20,285 --> 00:20:24,512
好啊
-爸爸的 -谢谢
...one for Dad. - Oh, thank you. Thank you.

332
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:26,660
-“烹调技术突飞猛进” -是的
All right.

333
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:29,420
- "Most Improved Cook of the Year." - Yes.

334
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:33,432
那圣诞晚餐我来下厨吧
That mean you all want me to make Christmas dinner?

335
00:20:33,432 --> 00:20:36,400
-不用了，谢谢 -宝贝，没事
- No, thanks. - It's okay, sweetheart.

336
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:39,280
-谢谢你 -爱你
- Thanks anyway. - We love you.

337
00:20:39,980 --> 00:20:43,960
正是
这就是让我等了一天的浪漫大礼？
Is this the exciting and romantic gift I've been waiting all day for?

338
00:20:44,020 --> 00:20:45,080
That's the one.

339
00:20:49,620 --> 00:20:50,820
来，我告诉你怎么用
Here, let me show you how it works.

340
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:54,760
让我瞧瞧
Let's see here.

341
00:20:56,240 --> 00:21:01,260
杰森，真漂亮 亲爱的，谢谢
Oh, Jason, they're beautiful. Thank you, honey.

342
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:02,261
-谢谢 -看上去像真的一样
- Thank you. - They look real, don't they?

343
00:21:02,261 --> 00:21:05,587
什么意思？假的？
What do you mean, aren't they real?

344
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:11,000
本，对不起，你没有礼物了
Ben, I'm so sorry. There's no gift for you.

345
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:12,500
想要回小狗吗？
Do you want Nick back?

346
00:21:13,020 --> 00:21:15,280
不，归你了
No, Walter, he's yours.

347
00:21:15,280 --> 00:21:19,000
波德维尔，去翻翻袋子 说不定有本的礼物
Walter, why don't you check the bag? Maybe Santa left something for Ben.

348
00:21:19,020 --> 00:21:21,000
怎么不去看看呢？
-对 -不，口袋空了
- Yeah. - No, it's empty.

349
00:21:21,420 --> 00:21:23,060
-说不定有呢 -是啊
Well, why don't you check it anyway?

350
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:24,780
袋子已经空了，所有的牛肉已经.
- There might be something there. - Yeah.

351
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:28,100
No, really, it's empty. See, we put the ground beef in the freezer...

352
00:21:28,300 --> 00:21:31,100
波德维尔，去看看吧
Walter, check the bag.

353
00:21:32,658 --> 00:21:38,163
-好吧 -我来拿着
- Oh, okay. Here. - Yes, I'll take him. Okay.

354
00:21:38,163 --> 00:21:41,364
-好的 -哇!
- There you go. - Oh, wow!

355
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:43,902
真有一份礼物
There is a present for Ben.

356
00:21:43,902 --> 00:21:47,000
-是吗？ -是啊
- There is? - Yeah.

357
00:21:47,760 --> 00:21:50,640
-给我的小狗 -对
- Wow, a puppy for me. - Yeah.

358
00:21:51,660 --> 00:21:53,600
跟你的一模一样
He looks just like Nick.

359
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:56,660
真谢谢你们
Well, thank you, all of you, for everything.

360
00:21:58,020 --> 00:21:59,540
小狗真漂亮
Nick is beautiful.

361
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:04,140
我的小狗也是，它叫做波德维尔
So is my puppy. I think I'll name her Walter.

362
00:22:06,860 --> 00:22:09,160
-圣诞快乐 -圣诞快乐
- Merry Christmas. - Merry Christmas.

363
00:22:17,820 --> 00:22:22,340
波德维尔，咱留点吃的给圣诞老人
Well, Walter, we'll just leave this little snack for Santa Claus...

364
00:22:22,700 --> 00:22:25,840
不是说我相信圣诞老人
which is not to say that I believe in Santa Claus...

365
00:22:26,320 --> 00:22:31,440
但俗语说，宁可信其有.
but in life, Walter, you'll find it pays to hedge your bets.

366
00:22:37,180 --> 00:22:40,000
呵呵，圣诞快乐!
Ho! Ho! Ho! Merry Christmas!

367
00:23:28,507 --> 00:23:31,496
